{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Gnezdo 是一款視覺化書籤管理工具，能將散落於不同位置的連結、截圖、筆記與靈感整理成個人資料庫，適合閱讀清單、食譜、研究筆記、旅遊計劃與工作項目等需要快速取用資料的人。現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-258.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>視覺化整理與快速搜尋</h2>\n<p>可從 iOS 分享選單、貼上網址、直接輸入筆記或加入相片保存內容，無需帳戶亦可即時使用。你可建立資料夾與子資料夾，加上彈性標籤，透過豐富預覽快速瀏覽收藏；可選 AI 分析會建議標題、摘要、標籤與合適資料夾。搜尋標題、描述與標籤即可找回素材，離線時仍可整理及搜尋。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-324-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-325-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-326-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-327-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-328-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Gnezdo: Save Links &amp; Notes</li><li>應用類別：Utilities</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/gnezdo-save-links-notes/id6768759708?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T20:24:16.665610+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":313,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T20:15:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T10:57:33.679231+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T20:17:46.714307+00:00","content_hash":"f85dbfd224133c1e61a799d2034987fe0e1ebffa381b78a3837f1e1a40843c03","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}